}, {
  "@context" : "https://schema.org",
  "@type" : "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity" : [ {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "What is IHG Hotels & Resorts?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "IHG Hotels & Resorts is one of the world's leading hospitality companies, offering a diverse portfolio of brands and collections designed to fit every travel style, occasion and budget from luxury and lifestyle experiences like Six Senses, Regent, InterContinental, Kimpton, Hotel Indigo and Vignette Collection; to premium stays such as Crowne Plaza, EVEN Hotels, Ruby Hotels, voco and HUALUXE; to trusted essentials including Holiday Inn, Holiday Inn Express, Holiday Inn Resort, Holiday Inn Club Vacations, Holiday Inn – the niu, avid hotels and Garner; plus all-suite options like Staybridge Suites, Candlewood Suites and Atwell Suites, as well as speciality offerings including Iberostar Beachfront Resorts ensuring the right stay for business, leisure, extended trips and everything in between."
    }
  }, {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "Why book directly with IHG?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "When you book directly with IHG through our website or mobile app, you get benefits that third-party travel sites simply can't offer. IHG One Rewards members unlock exclusive Member rates with savings up to 10% or more, earn valuable points to redeem for reward nights, get early access to special promotions and flash sales, and enjoy member-only perks like free Wi-Fi and Late Check-Out when available. Our best price guarantee ensures that you'll always get the lowest publicly available rate. Plus, booking directly gives you more flexibility to modify reservations and provides seamless integration with your IHG One Rewards account."
    }
  }, {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "What is IHG One Rewards?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "IHG One Rewards is our free, award-winning hotel loyalty programme with millions of members worldwide. When you join, your points never expire as long as your account remains active. You can redeem points for Reward Nights starting at just 10,000 points with no blackout dates. Members also enjoy exclusive Member rates that can save 10% or more, Late Check-Out when available and the opportunity to earn Elite Status as you stay more. Elite members unlock even greater perks, including complimentary room upgrades when available, bonus points and welcome amenities."
    }
  }, {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "How do I earn and redeem IHG One Rewards points?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "Earning points is simple and automatic. You earn points on every eligible stay at any of our thousands of hotels worldwide. You can also earn points through IHG One Rewards credit cards *, shopping and dining partners, and car hires. Redeeming points is just as easy. Use them for Reward Nights starting at 10,000 points with no blackout dates**, upgrade to premium rooms, redeem for gift cards and merchandise or combine Points + Cash to make your points go further. You can also buy, gift or transfer points through our Points Purchase programme to reach your travel goals faster. *IHG One Rewards credit cards are only available in selected regions. **Reward Night availability is limited and is subject to prior sale."
    }
  }, {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "Does IHG have a mobile app?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "Yes! The IHG One Rewards app is your travel companion for easier booking and better stays. Search and book from thousands of hotels worldwide, manage your reservations on the go, access exclusive mobile-only rates and use your digital room key at selected properties to skip the front desk entirely. You can also track your points, view your stays and get personalised offers tailored to your travel preferences. The app has won multiple awards and is available free on both iOS and Android devices."
    }
  }, {
    "@type" : "Question",
    "name" : "How do I contact IHG customer service?",
    "acceptedAnswer" : {
      "@type" : "Answer",
      "text" : "We're here to help 24/7! The easiest way to contact us is through the chat feature in the IHG One Rewards app or on IHG.com's customer care page, where you can get instant assistance with reservations, account questions and stay-related issues. You can also manage most requests directly through your IHG One Rewards account, including modifying or cancelling reservations, updating your profile and viewing your points balance. For post-stay concerns or feedback about your experience, you can also contact us through the “My Stays” section to connect with the specific property or our customer care team for resolution."
    }
  } ]
} ]


